<title>LATVIA: RIGAS RAUGS '96 PROFIT 178,522 LATS.</title>
<headline>RIGAS RAUGS '96 PROFIT 178,522 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rigas Raugs yeast factory made a profit of 178,522 lats in 1996 on turnover of 1.29 million lats, the stock exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>The bourse said in a statement that the company's 1996 production expenses came to 889,760 lats and it had a gross profit of 407,974 lats.</p>
<p>But it had extraordinary expenses of 28,083 lats which made it register an extraordinary loss before tax of 28,011 lats.</p>
<p>Raugs balance sheet shows undivided profit of 54,500 lats for the previous years and 176,922 for 1996.</p>
<p>The company's total balance sheet value was 707,425 lats and its basic capital was 423,000 lats.</p>
<p>It had no long-term debts and its short-term debts came to 48,403 lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
